  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Outgoing circular economy study visit</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to- Engage in government-to-government (G2G) policy dialogues with both central and local governments on key topics such as the circular economy, digital product passports, and circular architecture and infrastructure.- additionally, collaborate with a broader range of Japanese stakeholders, including municipalities, to establish a Japanese version of the Madaster platform, serving as a national resource bank for circular materials management.RemarkDue to the transparency with regard to the IATI projects, a non-ODA country has been included in this project.</narrative>
  </description>
